@* The shared document chrome, as a reusable component rather than appended
   markup.

   This is the part of the page every screen has in common: the brand line and the
   main landmark. It carries no @rendermode, so it stays statically server
   rendered, and it injects nothing — a layout with a repository is an
   authorization boundary nobody reads as one.

   It binds no data of any kind. The only text here is the fixed TaxAI brand. *@

@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<main>
    <p class="brand">TaxAI</p>
    @Body
</main>
